# Implementation Plan: Smooth Maps & Smart ETA

We will implement the remaining pending functionalities: Ola/Uber-like smooth map animations and Traffic-based accurate ETAs.

## Proposed Changes

### `apps/web-app` (Frontend)
- **Smooth Marker Animation**: 
  - Add a CSS rule in `globals.css` targeting `.leaflet-marker-icon`. 
  - We will apply a `transition: transform 1.5s linear` so that whenever the backend sends new coordinates, the Leaflet marker will smoothly glide to the new position instead of instantly jumping.

